with! Not just professional, but incredible people as well. I am grateful to have met the team here and toured their homes. They have a huge amount of projects that are affordable townhomes, yet are designed to look like a large single family house. I love this design because it takes a place and turns it into a home. So excited to see what they build next!'),(1547,89,'_content','field_testimonial_content'),(1762,93,'_edit_last','1'),(1763,93,'_edit_lock','1778579928:1'),(1764,93,'author-name','William'),(1765,93,'_author-name','field_testimonial_author-name'),(1766,93,'image',''),(1767,93,'_image','field_testimonial_image'),(1768,93,'content','Builder of the best houses in The Portland Area. It\'s been a great experience working alongside Dez Development seeing what this company is capable of. Definitely recommend.'),(1769,93,'_content','field_testimonial_content'),(2120,8,'page-blocks_3_testimonials-slider-text','WHAT OUR HOMEOWNERS SAY\r\n<h2>Real Stories from Real\r\nFamilies</h2>'),(2121,8,'_page-blocks_3_testimonials-slider-text','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_testimonials-slider_testimonials-slider-text'),(2122,8,'page-blocks_3_testimonials-slider-post-object','a:3:{i:0;s:2:\"89\";i:1;s:2:\"88\";i:2;s:2:\"87\";}'),(2123,8,'_page-blocks_3_testimonials-slider-post-object','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_testimonials-slider_testimonials-slider-post-object'),(2124,8,'page-blocks_4_reusable-block-post','103'),(2125,8,'_page-blocks_4_reusable-block-post','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_reusable-block_reusable-block-post'),(2266,101,'_wp_attached_file','2026/05/buyer-resources-hero-scaled.jpg'),(2267,101,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:7:{s:5:\"width\";i:2560;s:6:\"height\";i:1280;s:4:\"file\";s:39:\"2026/05/buyer-resources-hero-scaled.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:267114;s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:32:\"buyer-resources-hero-300x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:8889;}s:5:\"large\