Blocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(13225,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:265;76-340\">Dez Development LLC is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for people of all abilities, including people with disabilities. We are continually working to improve the user experience for everyone on our website and to apply relevant accessibility standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:258;342-599\">We believe every visitor — including current and prospective homebuyers, partners, and members of the public — should be able to browse our communities, available homes, buyer resources, and gallery content with ease, regardless of how they access the Site.</p>'),(13226,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(13227,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-label',''),(13228,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(13229,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','2. What Is Covered'),(13230,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(13231,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','h2'),(13232,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(13233,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:104;624-727\">This Accessibility Statement applies to the Dez Development LLC website, including the following areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-18:59;729-973\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:102;729-830\">Site navigation and menus (Communities, Available Homes, Buyer Resources, Gallery, About, Partners)</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:56;831-886\">Page content, including text, images, and floor plans</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:28;887-914\">Contact and inquiry forms</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:59;915-973\">Embedded media, such as photos and videos in the Gallery</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:59;915-973\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:30;975-1004\">Our Accessibility Efforts</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:245;1006-1250\">We aim to conform to the <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/\">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</a>, which help make web content more accessible to people with a wide range of disabilities. Our ongoing efforts include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-29:71;1252-1656\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:63;1252-1314\">Providing descriptive alternative text for meaningful images</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:63;1315-1377\">Maintaining clear and consistent navigation across all pages</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:62;1378-1439\">Using sufficient color contrast between text and background</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:93;1440-1532\">Structuring content with proper headings so it can be navigated using assistive technology</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:53;1533-1585\">Designing forms with clear labels and instructions</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:71;1586-1656\">Periodically reviewing and testing the Site for accessibility issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:22;1658-1679\">Known Limitations</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:326;1681-2006\">We are continually improving the accessibility of our Site. Despite our best efforts, some content or features may not yet be fully accessible. This may include older PDF documents, third-party embedded tools, or content provided by partners that is outside our direct control. We are actively working to address these areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:28;2008-2035\">Feedback and Assistance</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:242;2037-2278\">We welcome your feedback on the accessibility of the Dez Development LLC website. If you encounter a barrier, have difficulty accessing any content or feature, or would like to request information in an alternative format, please contact us:</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"39:1-42:16;2280-2344\"><strong>Dez Development LLC</strong> [Address] [Phone Number] [Email Address]</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"44:1-44:218;2346-2563\">We try to respond to accessibility feedback within [X] business days and will work with you to provide the information, item, or service you seek through an alternative communication method, where reasonably possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:24;2565-2588\">Third-Party Content</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"48:1-48:236;2590-2825\">Our Site may link to or include content from third parties, including partner organizations. We encourage our partners to meet accessibility standards, but we cannot guarantee the accessibility of websites or content we do not control.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:27;2827-2853\">Continuous Improvement</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:200;2855-3054\">Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We will continue to monitor our Site, incorporate accessibility best practices into future updates, and welcome feedback that helps us identify and resolve issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(13234,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(13235,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-label',''),(13236,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(13237,481,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections','2'),(13238,481,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections','fie