theast Ridgecrest Road\";s:17:\"street_name_short\";s:16:\"SE Ridgecrest Rd\";s:4:\"city\";s:12:\"Happy Valley\";s:5:\"state\";s:6:\"Oregon\";s:11:\"state_short\";s:2:\"OR\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:5:\"97086\";s:7:\"country\";s:13:\"United States\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(13345,504,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(13346,504,'property-buttons',''),(13347,504,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(13348,504,'property-description_label','About this home'),(13349,504,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(13350,504,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(13351,504,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(13352,504,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Welcome to 13226 SE Ridgecrest Rd — a stunning new construction home in the desirable Foxhaven Estates community of Happy Valley, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This spacious 2,987 sq ft residence offers 5 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, thoughtfully designed for modern family living. The home\'s striking exterior blends board-and-batten siding with natural stone accents, complemented by a 3-car garage and a warm, welcoming front entry.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Inside, you\'ll find generous living spaces perfect for both everyday comfort and entertaining, with room to grow across two well-appointed stories. Located in the sought-after Foxhaven Estates neighborhood, residents enjoy the charm of Happy Valley living with easy access to top-rated schools, parks, shopping, and dining.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home presents a rare opportunity to secure a brand-new build in one of the area\'s most desirable communities.</p>'),(13353,50