lose to Newell Creek Canyon Nature Park, Safeway, Fred Meyer, and neighborhood spots like Nebbiolo Restaurant and Corner 14 Food Carts.</p>'),(15555,554,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(15556,554,'property-description',''),(15557,554,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(15558,554,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(15559,554,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(15560,554,'property-payment_price',''),(15561,554,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(15562,554,'property-payment_details',''),(15563,554,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(15564,554,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(15565,554,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(15566,554,'property-payment',''),(15567,554,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(15574,554,'property-floor-plan_floors',''),(15575,554,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(15576,554,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(15577,554,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(15578,554,'property-floor-plan',''),(15579,554,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(15580,554,'property-testimonials',''),(15581,554,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(15582,554,'property-cta-single-property',''),(15583,554,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(15584,554,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(15585,554,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(15586,554,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title',''),(15587,554,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title'),(15588,554,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link',''),(15589,554,'_property-cards-grid_ca