:4:\"7456\";s:11:\"street_name\";s:23:\"Southeast Tolman Street\";s:17:\"street_name_short\";s:12:\"SE Tolman St\";s:4:\"city\";s:8:\"Portland\";s:5:\"state\";s:6:\"Oregon\";s:11:\"state_short\";s:2:\"OR\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:5:\"97206\";s:7:\"country\";s:13:\"United States\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(17317,627,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(17318,627,'property-buttons',''),(17319,627,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(17320,627,'property-description_label','About this home'),(17321,627,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(17322,627,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(17323,627,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(17324,627,'property-description_text','Welcome home. I’m a thoughtfully designed new construction offering modern attached living with comfort and long-term durability in mind, designed and developed by a multi-year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association. My main level lives large as a spacious open-concept great room, seamlessly connecting living, dining, and kitchen spaces for everyday comfort and entertaining. A slider off the living room opens to my substantially sized yard space, creating an ideal setting for outdoor living, entertaining, or play. At the heart of the home is a gourmet kitchen with generous solid surface countertop space, stainless steel appliances, and a large island with eat bar seating. A convenient half bath completes the main floor. Upstairs, I offer three bedrooms, including a primary suite with its own ensuite bathroom. The two additional bedrooms share a dedicated full bathroom just down the hall, and the laundry is located upstairs between the bedrooms. Energy-efficient ductless heat pump heating and cooling provides year-round comfort. Unlike many new construction homes, I am not a condo and have no HOA. You own the underlying land outright with no additional monthly dues. I’m located approximately 2.5–3 miles, about a 7–9 minute drive, to SE Woodstock Blvd with its shops, restaurants, cafés, and neighborhood bars, while everyday conveniences line nearby SE 82nd Avenue within roughly half a mile. Lents Park is approximately 1.1 miles away offering expansive greenspace.'),(17325,627,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(17326,627,'property-description',''),(17327,627,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(17328,627,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(17329,627,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(17330,627,'property-payment_price',''),(17331,627,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(17332,627,'property-payment_details',''),(17333,627,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(17334,627,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(17335,627,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(17336,627,'property-payment',''),(17337,627,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(17338,627,'property-floor-plan_floors',''),(17339,627,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(17340,627,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(17341,627,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(17342,627,'property-floor-plan',''),(17343,627,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(17344,627,'property-testimonials',''),(17345,627,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(17346,627,'property-cta-single-property',''),(17347,627,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(17348,627,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(17349,627,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(17350,627,'property-cards-g