_property-buttons'),(17467,645,'property-description_label','About this home'),(17468,645,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(17469,645,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(17470,645,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(17471,645,'property-description_text','Welcome home. I’m a thoughtfully designed new construction offering modern attached living with comfort and long-term durability in mind, designed and developed by a multi-year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association. My main level lives large as a spacious open-concept great room, seamlessly connecting living, dining, and kitchen spaces for everyday comfort and entertaining. A slider off the living room opens to my private, fenced patio for easy indoor-outdoor living. At the heart of the home is a gourmet kitchen with generous solid surface countertop space, stainless steel appliances, and a large island with eat bar seating. A convenient half bath completes the main floor. Upstairs, I offer two bedrooms, including a primary suite with its own ensuite bathroom. The additional bedroom has a dedicated full bathroom just down the hall, and the laundry is thoughtfully located upstairs between the bedrooms. Energy-efficient ductless heat pump heating and cooling provides year-round comfort. Unlike many new construction homes, I am not a condo and have no HOA. You own the underlying land outright and have no additional monthly dues to worry about. I’m located approximately 2.5–3 miles, about a 7–9 minute drive, to the heart of SE Woodstock Blvd with its shops, restaurants, cafés, and neighborhood bars, while everyday conveniences line nearby SE 82nd Avenue within roughly half a mile. Lents Park is approximately 1.1 miles away offering expansive greenspace.'),(17472,645,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(17473,645,'property-description',''),(17474,645,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(17475,645,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(17476,645,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(17477,645,'property-payment_price',''),(17478,645,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(17479,645,'property-payment_details',''),(17480,645,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(17481,645,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(17482,645,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(17483,645,'property-payment',''),(17484,645,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(17485,645,'property-floor-plan_floors',''),(17486,645,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(17487,645,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(17488,645,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(17489,645,'property-floor-plan',''),(17490,645,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(17491,645,'property-testimonials',''),(17492,645,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(17493,645,'property-cta-single-property',''),(17494,645,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(17495,645,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(17496,645,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(17497,645,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title',''),(17498,645,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title'),(17499,645,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link',''),(17500,645,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link'),(17501,645,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-columns','3'),(17502,645,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-columns','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-columns'),(17503,645,'proper