y_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(17617,661,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(17618,661,'property-buttons',''),(17619,661,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(17620,661,'property-description_label','About this home'),(17621,661,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(17622,661,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(17623,661,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(17624,661,'property-description_text','Welcome home. I’m a thoughtfully designed new construction offering modern attached living with comfort and long-term durability in mind, designed and developed by a multi-year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association. My main level lives large as a spacious open-concept great room, seamlessly connecting living, dining, and kitchen spaces for everyday comfort and entertaining. A slider off the living room opens to my private, fenced patio for easy indoor-outdoor living. At the heart of the home is a gourmet kitchen with generous solid surface countertop space, stainless steel appliances, and a large island with eat bar seating. A convenient half bath completes the main floor. Upstairs, I offer three bedrooms, including a primary suite with its own ensuite bathroom. The two additional bedrooms share a dedicated full bathroom just down the hall, and the laundry is thoughtfully located upstairs between the bedrooms. Energy-efficient ductless heat pump heating and cooling provides year-round comfort. Unlike many new construction homes, I am not a condo and have no HOA. You own the underlying land outright and have no additional monthly dues to worry about. I’m located approximately 2.5–3 miles, about a 7–9 minute drive, to the heart of SE Woodstock Blvd with its shops, restaurants, cafés, and neighborhood bars, while everyday conveniences line nearby SE 82nd Avenue within roughly half a mile. Lents Park is approximately 1.1 miles away offering expansive greenspace.'),(17625,661,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(17626,661,'property-description',''),(17627,661,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(17628,661,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(17629,661,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(17630,661,'property-payment_price',''),(17631,661,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(17632,661,'property-payment_details',''),(17633,661,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(17634,661,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(17635,661,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(17636,661,'property-payment',''),(17637,661,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(17638,661,'property-floor-plan_floors',''),(17639,661,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(17640,661,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(17641,661,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(17642,661,'property-floor-plan',''),(17643,661,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(17644,661,'property-testimonials',''),(17645,661,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(17646,661,'property-cta-single-property',''),(17647,661,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(17648,661,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(17649,661,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(17650,661,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title',''),(17651,661,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title'),(17652,661,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link',''),(17653,661,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link'),(17