6,'property-info_sqft','916'),(18192,706,'_property-info_sqft','field_property_property-info_sqft'),(18193,706,'property-info_floor-plan-name','Unit 5'),(18194,706,'_property-info_floor-plan-name','field_property_property-info_floor-plan-name'),(18195,706,'property-info',''),(18196,706,'_property-info','field_property_property-info'),(18197,706,'property-location','a:14:{s:7:\"address\";s:38:\"6181 N Albina AVE 5 Portland, OR 97217\";s:3:\"lat\";d:45.5678146;s:3:\"lng\";d:-122.675237;s:4:\"zoom\";i:10;s:8:\"place_id\";s:140:\"Ei02MTgxIE4gQWxiaW5hIEF2ZSAjNSwgUG9ydGxhbmQsIE9SIDk3MjE3LCBVU0EiOBo2CjESLwoUChIJE1Di8winlVQREMDY0AbFgG8QpTAqFAoSCaV7WnMIp5VUETNDDrTD5JxeEgE1\";s:13:\"street_number\";s:4:\"6181\";s:11:\"street_name\";s:19:\"North Albina Avenue\";s:17:\"street_name_short\";s:12:\"N Albina Ave\";s:4:\"city\";s:8:\"Portland\";s:5:\"state\";s:6:\"Oregon\";s:11:\"state_short\";s:2:\"OR\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:5:\"97217\";s:7:\"country\";s:13:\"United States\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(18198,706,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(18199,706,'property-buttons',''),(18200,706,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(18201,706,'property-description_label','About this home'),(18202,706,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(18203,706,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(18204,706,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(18205,706,'property-description_text','Tucked at the back of a five home N Albina townhome community, I offer a quieter setting with efficient new construction design, private fenced patio space, and Peninsula Park directly across the street. Step out the door and the park is just a few moments away, making it easy to enjoy the rose garden, open lawn, playground, walking paths, and everyday green space without needing to drive. Built by a multi-year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association, I offer a smart two bedroom, 2.1 bathroom layout with 916 square feet of well planned living space. My main level keeps the living, dining, and kitchen areas connected for an easy daily flow, with custom cabinetry, solid surface countertops, stainless steel appliances, an island, and practical storage. A half bathroom on the main level adds convenience for guests and everyday use. Upstairs, two bedrooms and two full bathrooms create a comfortable layout for shared living, guests, office needs, hobbies, or a more functional work from home setup. Mini splits provide efficient year round heating and cooling, adding comfort and control through every season. From this North Portland location, start the morning with a quick walk through Peninsula Park, take the MAX Yellow Line when you want to skip driving, explore Mississippi or Williams for dinner, drinks, shopping, and local energy, or use Killingsworth and Interstate for coffee, groceries, errands, and easy commuting routes.'),(18206,706,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(18207,706,'property-description',''),(18208,706,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(18209,706,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(18210,706,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(18211,706,'property-payment_price',''),(18212,706,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(18213,706,'property-payment_details',''),(18214,706,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(18215,706,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(18216,706,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(18217,706,'property-payment',''),(18218,706,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(18219,706,'property-floor-plan_floors','1'),(18220,706,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(18221,706,'property-floor-plan