s'),(18341,723,'property-description_label','About this home'),(18342,723,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(18343,723,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(18344,723,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(18345,723,'property-description_text','I pair the ease of new construction with a North Portland setting directly across the street from Peninsula Park, where the rose garden, open lawn, playground, walking paths, and neighborhood green space are just a few steps away. Built by a multi-year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association, I offer a smart two bedroom, 2.1 bathroom layout in a five home N Albina townhome community. At 903 square feet, I make efficient use of space without unnecessary upkeep, while still offering the privacy and function of two upper level suites. My main level keeps the living, dining, and kitchen areas connected for a simple daily flow, with custom cabinetry, solid surface countertops, stainless steel appliances, an island, and practical storage. A half bathroom on the main level adds convenience for guests and daily routines, while the compact footprint helps keep the home approachable, efficient, and easy to furnish. Upstairs, two bedrooms and two full bathrooms create a strong layout for shared living, guest space, office needs, hobbies, or a more comfortable work from home setup. Mini splits provide efficient year round heating and cooling, adding comfort and control through every season. From this Albina location, start the day with a quick park walk, spend an afternoon relaxing on the lawn at Peninsula Park, take the MAX Yellow Line into the city, meet up along Mississippi or Williams for food, drinks, shopping, and neighborhood energy, or use Killingsworth and Interstate for groceries, errands, casual meals, and easy commuting routes.'),(18346,723,'_property-description_text','field_pro