roperty-location','a:14:{s:7:\"address\";s:37:\"3864 NE Alberta CT Portland, OR 97211\";s:3:\"lat\";d:45.5581361;s:3:\"lng\";d:-122.6238222;s:4:\"zoom\";i:10;s:8:\"place_id\";s:27:\"ChIJJaVu08SmlVQR85wFvJbybXY\";s:13:\"street_number\";s:4:\"3864\";s:11:\"street_name\";s:23:\"Northeast Alberta Court\";s:17:\"street_name_short\";s:13:\"NE Alberta Ct\";s:4:\"city\";s:8:\"Portland\";s:5:\"state\";s:6:\"Oregon\";s:11:\"state_short\";s:2:\"OR\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:5:\"97211\";s:7:\"country\";s:13:\"United States\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(18481,736,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(18482,736,'property-buttons',''),(18483,736,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(18484,736,'property-description_label','About this home'),(18485,736,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(18486,736,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(18487,736,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(18488,736,'property-description_text','Step into a fresh take on detached living in the heart of Beaumont-Wilshire. This newly built cottage style home offers a rare opportunity to own a thoughtfully designed residence with no HOA and no monthly dues, while enjoying the flexibility of owning the underlying land. Positioned with frontage along Alberta, the home benefits from strong presence and access to one of NE Portland’s most vibrant corridors. Built by a multi year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association, it reflects a commitment to quality, efficiency, and livability. Inside, the main level features a great room style layout connecting living, dining, and kitchen spaces in a functional and comfortable way. Large windows bring in natural light, while the kitchen includes brand new stainless steel appliances, solid surface countertops, and a layout suited for everyday living. A half bath on the main level adds convenience. Upstairs, all three bedrooms are thoughtfully arranged, including a primary suite with ensuite bathroom, plus an additional full bathroom and laundry space conveniently located upstairs. Mini split systems provide efficient heating and cooling year round. Life here extends well beyond the front door. Spend weekends grabbing fresh pastries and artisan bread from Grand Central Bakery, pick up locally sourced groceries at Beaumont Market or New Seasons, and enjoy made to order doughnuts and coffee from Pip’s Original. Meet friends for dinner at the longtime neighborhood favorite Amalfi’s, or unwind with open green space, sports courts, and summer afternoons at Wilshire Park. Beaumont-Wilshire continues to be one of NE Portland’s most sought after neighborhoods for its blend of established character, walkability, and convenient access to local dining, neighborhood shops, parks, and everyday essentials. Designed for everyday comfort, with a location that keeps you connected.'),(18489,736,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(18490,736,'property-description',''),(18491,736,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(18492,736,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(18493,736,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(18494,736,'property-payment_price',''),(18495,736,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(18496,736,'property-payment_details',''),(18497,736,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(18498,736,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(18499,736,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(18500,736,'property-payment',''),(18501,736,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(18502,736,'property-floor-plan_floors','2'),(18503,736,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(18504,736,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(