"state_short\";s:2:\"OR\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:5:\"97211\";s:7:\"country\";s:13:\"United States\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(18622,750,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(18623,750,'property-buttons',''),(18624,750,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(18625,750,'property-description_label','About this home'),(18626,750,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(18627,750,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(18628,750,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(18629,750,'property-description_text','Step into something new on one of NE Portland’s most connected corridors. This newly built detached cottage sits on a prime corner lot in Beaumont-Wilshire, offering added presence, natural light, and the freedom of owning the underlying land with no HOA and no monthly dues. Built by a multi year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association, this home blends thoughtful design with everyday livability and long term efficiency. The main level opens into a great room style layout that connects living, dining, and kitchen spaces in a way that feels both open and functional. Large windows bring in natural light throughout the day, while the kitchen is equipped with brand new stainless steel appliances, solid surface countertops, and a layout designed for both daily use and gathering. A conveniently located half bath on the main level adds flexibility for guests. Upstairs, both bedrooms are designed as private ensuites, each with its own full bathroom, creating an ideal setup for flexibility and privacy. The front primary suite features a full walk in closet and a bright, open feel. Laundry space is conveniently located upstairs to simplify daily routines. Mini split systems provide efficient heating and cooling year round, supporting comfort in every season. Positioned near Beaumont Village, you’re moments from grabbing fresh groceries at Beaumont Market, weekend pastries at Grand Central Bakery, or coffee and made to order doughnuts from Pip’s Original. Spend afternoons at Wilshire Park, enjoy a classic Portland dinner at Amalfi’s, or make a quick run to New Seasons Market for everyday essentials. Designed for everyday comfort, with a location that keeps you connected.'),(18630,750,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(18631,750,'property-description',''),(18632,750,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(18633,750,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(18634,750,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(18635,750,'property-payment_price',''),(18636,750,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(18637,750,'property-payment_details',''),(18638,750,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(18639,750,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(18640,750,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(18641,750,'property-payment',''),(18642,750,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(18643,750,'property-floor-plan_floors','2'),(18644,750,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(18645,750,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(18646,750,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(18647,750,'property-floor-plan',''),(18648,750,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(18649,750,'property-testimonials',''),(18650,750,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(18651,750,'property-cta-single-property',''),(18652,750,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(18653,750,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(18654,750,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(1865