n architecture, elevated Oregon City views, and intentional luxury with custom construction from a multi year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association. Set on a ~0.28 acre lot, this 4,216 sqft estate offers 5 bedrooms, 5.5 bathrooms, and a layout designed for privacy, comfort, and memorable living. A striking exterior with steep A frame gables, dark vertical siding, warm accents, and natural textures creates a refined Pacific Northwest presence. Inside, a grand foyer opens to a sun drenched great room with soaring ceilings, natural light, and a gas fireplace anchoring the main living area. The kitchen supports daily rhythm and hosting with gas appliances, an oversized island, eat bar, butler\'s pantry, and generous prep space. The dining area extends to a vaulted covered deck overlooking professional landscaping, scenic hills, and views toward downtown Portland, setting the stage for quiet mornings, sunset dinners, and evenings above the city. The main level primary ensuite offers a private retreat with soaking tub, dual vanities, and walk in closet. A main level flex room adds space for work, guests, or creative use, while the semi detached guest quarters include an ensuite bathroom, walk in closet, kitchenette, and a gas fireplace. The attached 3 car garage supports protected parking, storage, and a polished everyday arrival. The wellness suite adds a private sauna, cold plunge tub, full bathroom, and room for a gym, creating a restorative escape without leaving home. Upstairs, two bedrooms with walk in closets, a full bathroom, and bonus space add room for media, hobbies, or retreat. Serres Farms offers polished streetscapes, scenic surroundings, estate caliber neighboring homes, and a sense of arrival that elevates daily life with room to gather, unwind, and enjoy views.'),(18755,763,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(18756,763,'property-description',''),(18757,763,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(18758,763,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(18759,763,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(18760,763,'property-payment_price',''),(18761,763,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(18762,763,'property-payment_details',''),(18763,763,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(18764,763,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(18765,763,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(18766,763,'property-payment',''),(18767,763,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(18768,763,'property-floor-plan_floors',''),(18769,763,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(18770,763,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(18771,763,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(18772,763,'property-floor-plan',''),(18773,763,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(18774,763,'property-testimonials',''),(18775,763,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(18776,763,'property-cta-single-property',''),(18777,763,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(18778,763,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(18779,763,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(18780,763,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title',''),(18781,763,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title'),(18782,763,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link',''),(18783,763,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link'),(18784,763,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-columns','3'),(18785,763,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-columns','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-columns'),(18786,763,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-p