'Welcome home. Nestled in a peaceful, park-like setting with no HOA, I’m part of a thoughtfully designed collection of detached cottages built by a multi-year Street of Dreams builder and Builder of the Year award winner by the Home Building Association. Created to make homeownership attainable without compromising quality, I combine durable construction, custom finishes, and timeless design at an accessible price point. Inside, soaring ceilings and expansive picture windows fill the home with natural light, enhancing the open great room layout that seamlessly connects the living, dining, and kitchen spaces. The gourmet kitchen is equipped with custom cabinetry, generous storage, solid surface countertops, and stainless steel appliances, offering both style and everyday functionality. Energy-efficient mini-split systems provide reliable heating and cooling for year-round comfort. Upstairs, two spacious bedrooms offer privacy and flexibility. The primary suite serves as a relaxing retreat with an en-suite bathroom, while the second bedroom is ideal for guests, family, or a dedicated work-from-home space and is supported by a full hall bath. Outside, a fully fenced private yard creates usable outdoor space for pets, gardening, or entertaining, while a shared community fire pit encourages connection and gathering. Six parking spaces are available within the community on a first-come, first-served basis, adding everyday convenience without monthly dues. A one-year builder warranty provides added peace of mind.'),(19653,853,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(19654,853,'property-description',''),(19655,853,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(19656,853,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(19657,853,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(19658,853,'property-payment_price',''),(19659,853,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(19660,853,'pr