y functionality. Energy-efficient mini-split systems provide reliable heating and cooling for year-round comfort. Upstairs, two spacious bedrooms offer privacy and flexibility. The primary suite serves as a relaxing retreat with an en-suite bathroom, while the second bedroom is ideal for guests, family, or a dedicated work-from-home space and is supported by a full hall bath. Outside, a fully fenced private yard creates usable outdoor space for pets, gardening, or entertaining, while a shared community fire pit encourages connection and gathering. Six parking spaces are available within the community on a first-come, first-served basis, adding everyday convenience without monthly dues. A one-year builder warranty provides added peace of mind.'),(19849,874,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(19850,874,'property-description',''),(19851,874,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(19852,874,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(19853,874,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(19854,874,'property-payment_price',''),(19855,874,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(19856,874,'property-payment_details',''),(19857,874,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(19858,874,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(19859,874,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(19860,874,'property-payment',''),(19861,874,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(19862,874,'property-floor-plan_floors','1'),(19863,874,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(19864,874,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(19865,874,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(19866,874,'property-floor-plan',''),(19867,874,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(19868,874,'property-testimonials',''),(19869