llect, use, and protect your information.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:210;2231-2440\">We do not guarantee a response time to any inquiry submitted through the Site, and submitting a form does not create any contractual relationship, reservation, or obligation on the part of Dez Development LLC.</p>'),(21179,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_3_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21180,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_3_section-label',''),(21181,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_3_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21182,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-title','5. Listings, Pricing, and Availability'),(21183,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21184,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','h2'),(21185,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21186,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-content','Information about communities, available homes, floor plans, pricing, square footage, features, and availability is provided for general informational purposes only and is subject to change without notice. We make reasonable efforts to keep this information accurate and up to date, but we do not guarantee or warrant that any information on the Site is complete, current, or error-free. Homes may sell or become unavailable, and pricing and incentives may change at any time. Nothing on this Site constitutes an offer to sell real property in any jurisdiction where such an offer would be unlawful.'),(21187,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21188,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-label',''),(21189,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_4_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21190,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-title','6. Intellectual Property'),(21191,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21192,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','h2'),(21193,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21194,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-content','All content on the Site — including text, graphics, logos, images, photographs, floor plans, renderings, and the overall look and feel of the Site — is the property of Dez Development LLC or its licensors and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. You may not copy, reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from any content on the Site without our prior written consent, except as necessary to view the Site for your own personal, non-commercial use.'),(21195,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21196,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-label',''),(21197,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_5_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21198,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-title','7. Third-Party Links and Partners'),(21199,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21200,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-title-tag','h2'),(21201,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21202,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-content','The Site may contain links to third-party websites, including partner organizations referenced on the Site (for example, under \"Partners\"). These links are provided for your convenience only. We do not control and are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any third-party website, and inclusion of a link does not imply our endorsement of that site.'),(21203,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21204,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-label',''),(21205,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_6_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21206,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-title','8. Disclaimer of Warranties'),(21207,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21208,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-title-tag','h2'),(21209,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21210,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-content','The Site and all content provided on it are offered \"as is\" and \"as available,\" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Site will be uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.'),(21211,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21212,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-label',''),(21213,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_7_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21214,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-title','9. Limitation of Liability'),(21215,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21216,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-title-tag','h2'),(21217,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21218,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-content','To the fullest extent permitted by law, Dez Development LLC and its officers, employees, and agents shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of, or inability to use, the Site, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages.'),(21219,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21220,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-label',''),(21221,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_8_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21222,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-title','10. Governing Law'),(21223,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21224,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-title-tag','h2'),(21225,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21226,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-content','These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Oregon, without regard to its conflict of law principles. Any disputes arising out of or relating to these Terms or your use of the Site shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts located in Oregon.'),(21227,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21228,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-label',''),(21229,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_9_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21230,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-title','11. Changes to These Terms'),(21231,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21232,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-title-tag','h2'),(21233,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21234,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-content','We reserve the right to modify or replace these Terms at any time at our sole discretion. We will indicate the date these Terms were last revised at the top of this page. Your continued use of the Site following the posting of any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes.'),(21235,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21236,996,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-label',''),(21237,996,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_10_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21238,997,'page-blocks','a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"content-doc\";}'),(21239,997,'_page-blocks','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks'),(21240,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','1. Overview'),(21241,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21242,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','h2'),(21243,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21244,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:265;76-340\">Dez Development LLC is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for people of all abilities, including people with disabilities. We are continually working to improve the user experience for everyone on our website and to apply relevant accessibility standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:258;342-599\">We believe every visitor — including current and prospective homebuyers, partners, and members of the public — should be able to browse our communities, available homes, buyer resources, and gallery content with ease, regardless of how they access the Site.</p>'),(21245,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21246,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-label',''),(21247,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21248,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','2. What Is Covered'),(21249,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21250,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','h2'),(21251,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag');
INSERT INTO `wp_postmeta` VALUES (21252,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:104;624-727\">This Accessibility Statement applies to the Dez Development LLC website, including the following areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-18:59;729-973\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:102;729-830\">Site navigation and menus (Communities, Available Homes, Buyer Resources, Gallery, About, Partners)</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:56;831-886\">Page content, including text, images, and floor plans</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:28;887-914\">Contact and inquiry forms</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:59;915-973\">Embedded media, such as photos and videos in the Gallery</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:59;915-973\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:30;975-1004\">Our Accessibility Efforts</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:245;1006-1250\">We aim to conform to the <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/\">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</a>, which help make web content more accessible to people with a wide range of disabilities. Our ongoing efforts include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-29:71;1252-1656\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:63;1252-1314\">Providing descriptive alternative text for meaningful images</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:63;1315-1377\">Maintaining clear and consistent navigation across all pages</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:62;1378-1439\">Using sufficient color contrast between text and background</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:93;1440-1532\">Structuring content with proper headings so it can be navigated using assistive technology</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:53;1533-1585\">Designing forms with clear labels and instructions</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:71;1586-1656\">Periodically reviewing and testing the Site for accessibility issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:22;1658-1679\">Known Limitations</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:326;1681-2006\">We are continually improving the accessibility of our Site. Despite our best efforts, some content or features may not yet be fully accessible. This may include older PDF documents, third-party embedded tools, or content provided by partners that is outside our direct control. We are actively working to address these areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:28;2008-2035\">Feedback and Assistance</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:242;2037-2278\">We welcome your feedback on the accessibility of the Dez Development LLC website. If you encounter a barrier, have difficulty accessing any content or feature, or would like to request information in an alternative format, please contact us:</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"39:1-42:16;2280-2344\"><strong>Dez Development LLC</strong> [Address] [Phone Number] [Email Address]</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"44:1-44:218;2346-2563\">We try to respond to accessibility feedback within [X] business days and will work with you to provide the information, item, or service you seek through an alternative communication method, where reasonably possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:24;2565-2588\">Third-Party Content</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"48:1-48:236;2590-2825\">Our Site may link to or include content from third parties, including partner organizations. We encourage our partners to meet accessibility standards, but we cannot guarantee the accessibility of websites or content we do not control.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:27;2827-2853\">Continuous Improvement</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:200;2855-3054\">Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We will continue to monitor our Site, incorporate accessibility best practices into future updates, and welcome feedback that helps us identify and resolve issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(21253,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21254,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-label',''),(21255,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21256,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections','2'),(21257,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections'),(21258,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-updated',''),(21259,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-updated','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-updated'),(21260,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-show-reviewed','0'),(21261,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-show-reviewed','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-show-reviewed'),(21262,997,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-pdf',''),(21263,997,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-pdf','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-pdf'),(21264,998,'page-blocks','a:1:{i:0;s:11:\"content-doc\";}'),(21265,998,'_page-blocks','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks'),(21266,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','1. Overview'),(21267,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21268,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','h2'),(21269,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21270,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:265;76-340\">Dez Development LLC is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for people of all abilities, including people with disabilities. We are continually working to improve the user experience for everyone on our website and to apply relevant accessibility standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:258;342-599\">We believe every visitor — including current and prospective homebuyers, partners, and members of the public — should be able to browse our communities, available homes, buyer resources, and gallery content with ease, regardless of how they access the Site.</p>'),(21271,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21272,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-label',''),(21273,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_0_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21274,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','2. What Is Covered'),(21275,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21276,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','h2'),(21277,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21278,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:104;624-727\">This Accessibility Statement applies to the Dez Development LLC website, including the following areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-18:59;729-973\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:102;729-830\">Site navigation and menus (Communities, Available Homes, Buyer Resources, Gallery, About, Partners)</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:56;831-886\">Page content, including text, images, and floor plans</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:28;887-914\">Contact and inquiry forms</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:59;915-973\">Embedded media, such as photos and videos in the Gallery</li>\r\n 	<li data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:59;915-973\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:30;975-1004\">Our Accessibility Efforts</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:245;1006-1250\">We aim to conform to the <a class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/\">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</a>, which help make web content more accessible to people with a wide range of disabilities. Our ongoing efforts include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-29:71;1252-1656\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:63;1252-1314\">Providing descriptive alternative text for meaningful images</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"25:1-25:63;1315-1377\">Maintaining clear and consistent navigation across all pages</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:62;1378-1439\">Using sufficient color contrast between text and background</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"27:1-27:93;1440-1532\">Structuring content with proper headings so it can be navigated using assistive technology</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:53;1533-1585\">Designing forms with clear labels and instructions</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"29:1-29:71;1586-1656\">Periodically reviewing and testing the Site for accessibility issues</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:22;1658-1679\">Known Limitations</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"33:1-33:326;1681-2006\">We are continually improving the accessibility of our Site. Despite our best efforts, some content or features may not yet be fully accessible. This may include older PDF documents, third-party embedded tools, or content provided by partners that is outside our direct control. We are actively working to address these areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:28;2008-2035\">Feedback and Assistance</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:242;2037-2278\">We welcome your feedback on the accessibility of the Dez Development LLC website. If you encounter a barrier, have difficulty accessing any content or feature, or would like to request information in an alternative format, please contact us:</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"39:1-42:16;2280-2344\"><strong>Dez Development LLC</strong> [Address] [Phone Number] [Email Address]</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"44:1-44:218;2346-2563\">We try to respond to accessibility feedback within [X] business days and will work with you to provide the information, item, or service you seek through an alternative communication method, where reasonably possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:24;2565-2588\">Third-Party Content</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"48:1-48:236;2590-2825\">Our Site may link to or include content from third parties, including partner organizations. We encourage our partners to meet accessibility standards, but we cannot guarantee the accessibility of websites or content we do not control.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:27;2827-2853\">Continuous Improvement</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:200;2855-3054\">Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We will continue to monitor our Site, incorporate accessibility best practices into future updates, and welcome feedback that helps us identify and resolve issues.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>'),(21279,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21280,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-label',''),(21281,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21282,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections','2'),(21283,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-sections','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections'),(21284,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-updated',''),(21285,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-updated','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-updated'),(21286,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-show-reviewed','1'),(21287,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-show-reviewed','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-show-reviewed'),(21288,998,'page-blocks_0_content-doc-pdf',''),(21289,998,'_page-blocks_0_content-doc-pdf','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-pdf'),(21290,999,'_wp_attached_file','2026/05/102d86cd10f094f79c85