ections_3_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21536,1003,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','h2'),(21537,1003,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21538,1003,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','h2'),(21539,1003,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21540,3,'_wp_suggested_privacy_policy_content','a:3:{s:11:\"plugin_name\";s:9:\"WordPress\";s:11:\"policy_text\";s:4482:\"<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we are</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Our website address is: http://localhost:8888/codelibry-test-2.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Comments</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>When visitors leave comments on the site we collect the data shown in the comments form, and also the visitor&#8217;s IP address and browser user agent string to help spam detection.</p><p>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service to see if you are using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: https://automattic.com/privacy/. After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Media</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included. Visitors to the website can download and extract any location data from images on the website.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cookies</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment on our site you may opt-in to saving your name, email address and website in cookies. These are for your convenience so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. These cookies will last for one year.</p><p>If you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser accepts cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.</p><p>When you log in, we will also set up several cookies to save your login information and your screen display choices. Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you select &quot;Remember Me&quot;, your login will persist for two weeks. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed.</p><p>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie will be saved in your browser. This cookie includes no personal data and simply indicates the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Embedded content from other websites</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.</p><p>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who we share your data with</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How long we retain your data</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.</p><p>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What rights you have over your data</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.</p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where your data is sent</h2><p><strong class=\"privacy-policy-tutorial\">Suggested text: </strong>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service.</p>\";s:5:\"added\";i:1782897066;}'),(21670,1008,'page-blocks','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:11:\"content-doc\";}'),(21671,1008,'_page-blocks','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks'),(21672,1008,'page-blocks_0_hero-text','LEGAL\r\n<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\r\n<h3>Last updated July 2026</h3>'),(21673,1008,'_page-blocks_0_hero-text','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_hero_hero-text'),(21674,1008,'page-blocks_0_hero-image','346'),(21675,1008,'_page-blocks_0_hero-image','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_hero_hero-image'),(21676,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections','2'),(21677,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections'),(21678,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-updated','20260108'),(21679,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-updated','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-updated'),(21680,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-pdf','a:3:{s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Download PDF\";s:3:\"url\";s:84:\"http://localhost:8888/codelibry-test-2/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Privacy-Policy.pdf\";s:6:\"target\";s:6:\"_blank\";}'),(21681,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-pdf','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-pdf'),(21682,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','1. Overview'),(21683,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21684,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:407;67-473\">Dez Development LLC (\"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting it through this Privacy Policy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit our website (the \"Site\"), how we use that information, and the choices you have regarding it. By using the Site, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:152;475-626\">This Privacy Policy applies only to information collected through the Site and does not extend to information collected offline or through other means.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:48;651-698\">This Privacy Policy covers the following areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-22:35;700-1045\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:87;700-786\">The types of information we collect when you visit our Site or submit a contact form</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:40;787-826\">How we use and share that information</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:44;827-870\">Cookies and similar tracking technologies</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:34;871-904\">How we protect your information</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:53;905-957\">Your choices and rights regarding your information</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:32;958-989\">Links to third-party websites</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:21;990-1010\">Children\'s privacy</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:35;1011-1045\">How to contact us with questions</li>\r\n</ul>'),(21685,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21686,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-label',''),(21687,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21688,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','2. Information We Collect'),(21689,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21690,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:27;1047-1073\">Information We Collect</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:243;1075-1317\"><strong>Information you provide to us.</strong> When you submit an inquiry through our Contact Us form or other forms on the Site, we may collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, and any message or details you choose to provide.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:320;1319-1638\"><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit the Site, we and our service providers may automatically collect certain information about your device and usage, such as your IP address, browser type, pages visited, time spent on pages, and referring website, typically through cookies and similar technologies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:32;1640-1671\">How We Use Your Information</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"32:1-32:42;1673-1714\">We may use the information we collect to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"34:1-38:32;1716-2022\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:95;1716-1810\">Respond to your inquiries and communicate with you about our communities and available homes</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:32;1811-1842\">Improve and maintain the Site</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"36:1-36:88;1843-1930\">Understand how visitors use the Site, in order to improve content and user experience</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:60;1931-1990\">Send you information you have requested, where applicable</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"38:1-38:32;1991-2022\">Comply with legal obligations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"40:1-40:59;2024-2082\">We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"42:1-42:38;2084-2121\">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"44:1-44:329;2123-2451\">Our Site may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience and analyze Site traffic. You can set your browser to refuse all or some cookies, or to alert you when cookies are being sent. If you disable or refuse cookies, some parts of the Site may become inaccessible or not function properly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:27;2453-2479\">Sharing of Information</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"48:1-48:429;2481-2909\">We may share information with third-party service providers who perform services on our behalf, such as website hosting, form processing, or analytics, and who are bound to keep your information confidential and use it only for the purposes for which we disclose it to them. We may also disclose information if required to do so by law, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Dez Development LLC, our users, or others.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:18;2911-2928\">Data Security</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:290;2930-3219\">We take reasonable measures to protect the information we collect from loss, misuse, and unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"54:1-54:17;3221-3237\">Your Choices</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"56:1-56:322;3239-3560\">You may choose not to provide certain information, though this may limit your ability to use certain features of the Site, such as submitting a contact form. If you would like to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information you have submitted to us, please contact us using the information below.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"58:1-58:22;3562-3583\">Third-Party Links</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"60:1-60:247;3585-3831\">Our Site may contain links to third-party websites, including partner organizations. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party site you visit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"62:1-62:23;3833-3855\">Children\'s Privacy</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"64:1-64:242;3857-4098\">The Site is not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have inadvertently collected such information, we will take steps to delete it.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"66:1-66:35;4100-4134\">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"68:1-68:180;4136-4315\">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised \"Last Updated\" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>'),(21691,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21692,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-label',''),(21693,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21694,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-show-reviewed','1'),(21695,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-show-reviewed','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-show-reviewed'),(21696,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','h2'),(21697,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21698,1008,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','h2'),(21699,1008,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21700,1009,'page-blocks','a:2:{i:0;s:4:\"hero\";i:1;s:11:\"content-doc\";}'),(21701,1009,'_page-blocks','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks'),(21702,1009,'page-blocks_0_hero-text','LEGAL\r\n<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\r\n<h3>Last updated July 2026</h3>'),(21703,1009,'_page-blocks_0_hero-text','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_hero_hero-text'),(21704,1009,'page-blocks_0_hero-image','346'),(21705,1009,'_page-blocks_0_hero-image','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_hero_hero-image'),(21706,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections','2'),(21707,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections'),(21708,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-updated','20260108'),(21709,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-updated','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-updated'),(21710,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-pdf',''),(21711,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-pdf','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-pdf'),(21712,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','1. Overview'),(21713,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21714,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:407;67-473\">Dez Development LLC (\"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting it through this Privacy Policy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect when you visit our website (the \"Site\"), how we use that information, and the choices you have regarding it. By using the Site, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:152;475-626\">This Privacy Policy applies only to information collected through the Site and does not extend to information collected offline or through other means.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:48;651-698\">This Privacy Policy covers the following areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-22:35;700-1045\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:87;700-786\">The types of information we collect when you visit our Site or submit a contact form</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:40;787-826\">How we use and share that information</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:44;827-870\">Cookies and similar tracking technologies</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:34;871-904\">How we protect your information</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:53;905-957\">Your choices and rights regarding your information</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"20:1-20:32;958-989\">Links to third-party websites</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"21:1-21:21;990-1010\">Children\'s privacy</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"22:1-22:35;1011-1045\">How to contact us with questions</li>\r\n</ul>'),(21715,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21716,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-label',''),(21717,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21718,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','2. Information We Collect'),(21719,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(21720,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"24:1-24:27;1047-1073\">Information We Collect</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:243;1075-1317\"><strong>Information you provide to us.</strong> When you submit an inquiry through our Contact Us form or other forms on the Site, we may collect information such as your name, email address, phone number, and any message or details you choose to provide.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"28:1-28:320;1319-1638\"><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit the Site, we and our service providers may automatically collect certain information about your device and usage, such as your IP address, browser type, pages visited, time spent on pages, and referring website, typically through cookies and similar technologies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"30:1-30:32;1640-1671\">How We Use Your Information</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"32:1-32:42;1673-1714\">We may use the information we collect to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\" data-sourcepos=\"34:1-38:32;1716-2022\">\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:95;1716-1810\">Respond to your inquiries and communicate with you about our communities and available homes</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"35:1-35:32;1811-1842\">Improve and maintain the Site</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"36:1-36:88;1843-1930\">Understand how visitors use the Site, in order to improve content and user experience</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"37:1-37:60;1931-1990\">Send you information you have requested, where applicable</li>\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\" data-sourcepos=\"38:1-38:32;1991-2022\">Comply with legal obligations</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"40:1-40:59;2024-2082\">We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"42:1-42:38;2084-2121\">Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"44:1-44:329;2123-2451\">Our Site may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience and analyze Site traffic. You can set your browser to refuse all or some cookies, or to alert you when cookies are being sent. If you disable or refuse cookies, some parts of the Site may become inaccessible or not function properly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"46:1-46:27;2453-2479\">Sharing of Information</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"48:1-48:429;2481-2909\">We may share information with third-party service providers who perform services on our behalf, such as website hosting, form processing, or analytics, and who are bound to keep your information confidential and use it only for the purposes for which we disclose it to them. We may also disclose information if required to do so by law, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Dez Development LLC, our users, or others.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"50:1-50:18;2911-2928\">Data Security</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"52:1-52:290;2930-3219\">We take reasonable measures to protect the information we collect from loss, misuse, and unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"54:1-54:17;3221-3237\">Your Choices</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"56:1-56:322;3239-3560\">You may choose not to provide certain information, though this may limit your ability to use certain features of the Site, such as submitting a contact form. If you would like to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information you have submitted to us, please contact us using the information below.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"58:1-58:22;3562-3583\">Third-Party Links</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"60:1-60:247;3585-3831\">Our Site may contain links to third-party websites, including partner organizations. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any third-party site you visit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"62:1-62:23;3833-3855\">Children\'s Privacy</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"64:1-64:242;3857-4098\">The Site is not directed at children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If we become aware that we have inadvertently collected such information, we will take steps to delete it.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold\" data-sourcepos=\"66:1-66:35;4100-4134\">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\" data-sourcepos=\"68:1-68:180;4136-4315\">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised \"Last Updated\" date. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>'),(21721,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(21722,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-label',''),(21723,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(21724,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-show-reviewed','1'),(21725,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-show-reviewed','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-show-reviewed'),(21726,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','h2'),(21727,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_0_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21728,1009,'page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','h2'),(21729,1009,'_page-blocks_1_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(21730,519,'_thumbnail_id','345'),(21811,66,'_wp_old_date','2026-05-29'),(21812,507,'_wp_old_date','2026-05-29'),(21814,1011,'_edit_lock','1783088459:1'),(21815,1012,'_wp_attached_file','2026/07/Prespective-scaled.jpg'),(21816,1012,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:7:{s:5:\"width\";i:2560;s:6:\"height\";i:1440;s:4:\"file\";s:30:\"2026/07/Prespective-scaled.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:1108018;s:5:\"sizes\";a:6:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:23:\"Prespective-300x169.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:169;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:17986;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:24:\"Prespective-1024x576.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:576;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:178494;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:23:\"Prespective-150x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:7839;}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:23:\"Prespective-768x432.jpg\";s:5:\"wid