s:11:\"state_short\";s:2:\"OR\";s:9:\"post_code\";s:5:\"97086\";s:7:\"country\";s:13:\"United States\";s:13:\"country_short\";s:2:\"US\";}'),(21838,1011,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(21839,1011,'property-buttons',''),(21840,1011,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(21841,1011,'property-description_label','About this home'),(21842,1011,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(21843,1011,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(21844,1011,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(21845,1011,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Introducing 13310 SE Gray Fox Ln — a striking modern home in the exclusive Foxhaven Estates community, proudly featured as an upcoming Street of Dreams showcase home.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This exceptional 3,749 sq ft residence offers 4 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, with a spacious 3-car garage. The architecture makes a bold statement, blending natural stone, warm wood siding, and dark-framed windows for a sophisticated, contemporary aesthetic. A dramatic covered upper deck and terraced landscaping take full advantage of the sloped, tree-lined lot, while an elegant staircase entry leads to a striking glass-paneled front door.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Inside, expect the same level of thoughtful design and premium finishes that have earned this home its place among the region\'s most anticipated new builds. With soaring windows that flood the interior with natural light and an open layout built for both everyday living and elevated entertaining, this home is designed to impress.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">As a featured Street of Dreams home, 13310 SE Gray Fox Ln represents the very best of what Foxhaven Estates has to offer. Currently under construction, this is a rare opportunity to own a true showcase property.</p>'),(21846,1011,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(21847,1011,'property-description',''),(21848,1011,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(21849,1011,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(21850,1011,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(21851,1011,'property-payment_price',''),(21852,1011,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(21853,1011,'property-payment_details',''),(21854,1011,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(21855,1011,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(21856,1011,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(21857,1011,'property-payment',''),(21858,1011,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(21859,1011,'property-floor-plan_floors','2'),(21860,1011,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(21861,1011,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(21862,1011,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','field_property_property-floor-plan_pdf-link'),(21863,1011,'property-floor-plan',''),(21864,1011,'_property-floor-plan','field_property_property-floor-plan'),(21865,1011,'property-testimonials',''),(21866,1011,'_property-testimonials','field_property_property-testimonials'),(21867,1011,'property-cta-single-property',''),(21868,1011,'_property-cta-single-property','field_property_property-cta-single-property'),(21869,1011,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label',''),(21870,1011,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-label'),(21871,1011,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title',''),(21872,1011,'_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title','field_property_property-cards-grid_cards-grid-title'),(21873,1011,'property-cards-grid_cards-grid-link',''),(21874,1011,'_propert