ription_title','Property Description'),(22192,1019,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(22193,1019,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Welcome to 5129 SE Aldona Ct — a modern new construction duplex home in the Robbins Place community of Milwaukie, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This efficiently designed home offers 1,427 sq ft of living space with 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a 1-car garage. As Unit 1 of this duplex, it features a private entry and garage, along with a clean, contemporary exterior that combines horizontal siding with vertical board-and-batten accents and warm bronze trim.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">The two-story layout makes smart use of space, offering a comfortable and low-maintenance living option ideal for first-time buyers, small families, or anyone looking to simplify. Located in the Robbins Place community, this home offers easy access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks in a quiet, walkable setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new, move-in-ready property in a well-connected Milwaukie neighborhood.</p>'),(22194,1019,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(22195,1019,'property-description',''),(22196,1019,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(22197,1019,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(22198,1019,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(22199,1019,'property-payment_price',''),(22200,1019,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(22201,1019,'property-payment_details',''),(22202,1019,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(22203,1