ty_property-buttons'),(22309,1022,'property-description_label','About this home'),(22310,1022,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(22311,1022,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(22312,1022,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(22313,1022,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Welcome to 5133 SE Aldona Ct — Unit 1 of a modern new construction duplex in the Robbins Place community of Milwaukie, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This home offers 1,427 sq ft of living space with 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a 1-car garage. As Unit 1 of this duplex, it features its own private entry and garage, along with a clean, contemporary exterior that combines horizontal siding with warm wood-toned trim and gabled rooflines.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">The two-story layout makes smart use of space, offering a comfortable and low-maintenance living option ideal for first-time buyers, small families, or anyone looking to simplify. Located in the Robbins Place community, this home offers easy access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks in a quiet, walkable setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new, move-in-ready property in a well-connected Milwaukie neighborhood.</p>'),(22314,1022,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(22315,1022,'property-description',''),(22316,1022,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(22317,1022,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(22318,1022,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(22319,1022,'property-payment_price',''),(22320,1022,'_property-payment_price','fi