bel','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(22803,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title','3. What Is Not Covered'),(22804,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(22805,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title-tag','h2'),(22806,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(22807,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Certain items may fall outside of warranty support, including normal wear and tear, routine homeowner maintenance, damage resulting from misuse, unauthorized modifications, or circumstances beyond our control.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you are unsure whether a concern qualifies for review, please reach out to our team. We are happy to answer questions and provide guidance whenever possible.</p>'),(22808,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(22809,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-label','Not Covered'),(22810,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(22811,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title','4. How to Submit a Claim'),(22812,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(22813,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title-tag','h2'),(22814,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(22815,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">To submit a warranty claim or service request, please complete our online form and provide as much detail as possible.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Helpful information includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n 	<li>Property address</li>\r\n 	<li>Contact information</li>\r\n 	<li>Description of the issue</li>\r\n 	<li>Photos or supporting documentation, if available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nOnce we receive your request, a member of our team will review the information and follow up as needed.'),(22816,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(22817,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-label','Submit a Claim'),(22818,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(22819,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title','5. Emergency Procedures'),(22820,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(22821,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','h2'),(22822,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(22823,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you experience an issue that presents an immediate safety concern or could result in significant property damage, please take appropriate action to protect people and property first.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For emergencies involving fire, gas, electrical hazards, flooding, or other urgent situations, contact the appropriate emergency services or utility provider immediately.</p>\r\nAfter the situation has been addressed, please notify DEZ Development so we can assist with any necessary follow-up.'),(22824,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(22825,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-label','Procedures'),(22826,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(22827,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title','6. Contact Information'),(22828,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(22829,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','h2'),(22830,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(22831,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For warranty inquiries, service requests, or general homeowner support, please contact our team.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><b>Dez Development </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Phone: (503) 994-6000</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Hello@dezdevelopment.com\">Hello@dezdevelopment.com</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">We appreciate the trust you place in DEZ Development and look forward to supporting you throughout your homeownership journey.</p>'),(22832,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(22833,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-label','Contact Information'),(22834,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(22835,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections','6'),(22836,1026,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections'),(22837,1026,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-updated',''),(22838,1026,'_page-block