operty-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(23328,1035,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Welcome to 5115 SE Aldona Ct — a modern new construction triplex home in the Robbins Place community of Milwaukie, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This home offers 1,729 sq ft of living space with 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a 1-car garage. As Unit 3 of this triplex, it features a private entry and garage, along with a striking modern exterior that blends horizontal siding, dark board-and-batten accents, and warm wood detailing for a fresh, contemporary look.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">The two-story layout offers comfortable, functional living space with room to spread out, making it a great fit for families, first-time buyers, or anyone seeking low-maintenance living in a stylish, modern home. Located in the Robbins Place community, this home offers convenient access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks in a quiet, established setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new build in a well-connected Milwaukie neighborhood.</p>'),(23329,1035,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(23330,1035,'property-description',''),(23331,1035,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(23332,1035,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(23333,1035,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(23334,1035,'property-payment_price',''),(23335,1035,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(23336,1035,'property-payment_details',''),(23337,1035,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(23338,1035,'property-payment_calcula