ription_title','Property Description'),(23458,1039,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(23459,1039,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Discover 13258 SE Ridgecrest Rd — a beautifully designed new construction home in the Foxhaven Estates community of Happy Valley, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Offering 2,854 sq ft of thoughtfully planned living space, this home features 5 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, along with a 2-car garage. The exterior showcases classic horizontal siding with warm two-tone accents, large picture windows, and lush, professionally landscaped grounds that create instant curb appeal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Inside, an open and functional layout provides plenty of room for family living and entertaining alike. Nestled in the desirable Foxhaven Estates neighborhood, this home offers the perfect blend of privacy and community, with Happy Valley\'s excellent schools, parks, and amenities just minutes away.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home is a wonderful opportunity to own a brand-new build in one of the region\'s most sought-after neighborhoods.</p>'),(23460,1039,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(23461,1039,'property-description',''),(23462,1039,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(23463,1039,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(23464,1039,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(23465,1039,'property-payment_price',''),(23466,1039,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(23467,1039,'property-payment_details',''),(23468,1039,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(23469,1039,'property-paymen