y-location'),(23694,1051,'property-buttons',''),(23695,1051,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(23696,1051,'property-description_label','About this home'),(23697,1051,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(23698,1051,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(23699,1051,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(23700,1051,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Welcome to 5102 SE Aldona Ct — a beautifully designed new construction home in the Robbins Place community of Milwaukie, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This home offers 3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms in a smart, efficient layout, featuring a paired-home design with private garage and entry for each residence. The exterior combines classic horizontal siding with board-and-batten accents and warm bronze trim, creating a clean, contemporary curb appeal that fits beautifully into the neighborhood setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">With two stories of comfortable living space, this home is ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers, or anyone looking for low-maintenance living without sacrificing style. Located in the Robbins Place community, residents enjoy convenient access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks, all within a quiet, established neighborhood.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new build in a well-connected Milwaukie location.</p>'),(23701,1051,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(23702,1051,'property-description',''),(23703,1051,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(23704,1051,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(23705,1051,