operty-info_floor-plan-name'),(23821,1052,'property-info',''),(23822,1052,'_property-info','field_property_property-info'),(23823,1052,'property-location',''),(23824,1052,'_property-location','field_property_property-location'),(23825,1052,'property-buttons',''),(23826,1052,'_property-buttons','field_property_property-buttons'),(23827,1052,'property-description_label','About this home'),(23828,1052,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(23829,1052,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(23830,1052,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(23831,1052,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Welcome to 5131 SE Aldona Ct — a modern new construction duplex home in the Robbins Place community of Milwaukie, Oregon.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">This efficiently designed home offers 1,427 sq ft of living space with 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, and a 1-car garage. As Unit 1 of this duplex, it features a private entry and garage, along with a clean, contemporary exterior that combines horizontal siding with vertical board-and-batten accents and warm bronze trim.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">The two-story layout makes smart use of space, offering a comfortable and low-maintenance living option ideal for first-time buyers, small families, or anyone looking to simplify. Located in the Robbins Place community, this home offers easy access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks in a quiet, walkable setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new, move-in-ready property in a well-connected Milwaukie neighborhood.</p>'),(23832,1052,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(2383