s, first-time buyers, or anyone seeking low-maintenance living in a stylish, modern home. Located in the Robbins Place community, this home offers convenient access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks in a quiet, established setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new build in a well-connected Milwaukie neighborhood.</p>'),(24041,1055,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(24042,1055,'property-description',''),(24043,1055,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(24044,1055,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(24045,1055,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(24046,1055,'property-payment_price',''),(24047,1055,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(24048,1055,'property-payment_details',''),(24049,1055,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(24050,1055,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(24051,1055,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(24052,1055,'property-payment',''),(24053,1055,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(24054,1055,'property-floor-plan_floors_0_tab-name',''),(24055,1055,'_property-floor-plan_floors_0_tab-name','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors_tab-name'),(24056,1055,'property-floor-plan_floors_0_image','1038'),(24057,1055,'_property-floor-plan_floors_0_image','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors_image'),(24058,1055,'property-floor-plan_floors_0_sqft',''),(24059,1055,'_property-floor-plan_floors_0_sqft','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors_sqft'),(24060,1055,'property-floor-plan_floors','1'),(24061,1055,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(24062,1055,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(24063,1055,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link','fiel