ng option ideal for first-time buyers, small families, or anyone looking to simplify. Located in the Robbins Place community, this home offers easy access to Milwaukie\'s shops, restaurants, and parks in a quiet, walkable setting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Currently under construction, this home offers a great opportunity to own a brand-new, move-in-ready property in a well-connected Milwaukie neighborhood.</p>'),(24295,1058,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(24296,1058,'property-description',''),(24297,1058,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(24298,1058,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(24299,1058,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(24300,1058,'property-payment_price',''),(24301,1058,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(24302,1058,'property-payment_details',''),(24303,1058,'_property-payment_details','field_property_property-payment_details'),(24304,1058,'property-payment_calculator-link',''),(24305,1058,'_property-payment_calculator-link','field_property_property-payment_calculator-link'),(24306,1058,'property-payment',''),(24307,1058,'_property-payment','field_property_property-payment'),(24308,1058,'property-floor-plan_floors_0_tab-name',''),(24309,1058,'_property-floor-plan_floors_0_tab-name','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors_tab-name'),(24310,1058,'property-floor-plan_floors_0_image','1057'),(24311,1058,'_property-floor-plan_floors_0_image','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors_image'),(24312,1058,'property-floor-plan_floors_0_sqft',''),(24313,1058,'_property-floor-plan_floors_0_sqft','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors_sqft'),(24314,1058,'property-floor-plan_floors','1'),(24315,1058,'_property-floor-plan_floors','field_property_property-floor-plan_floors'),(24316,1058,'property-floor-plan_pdf-link',''),(24317,1058,'_property-floor-plan_pdf-link',