n_label','About this home'),(24665,1075,'_property-description_label','field_property_property-description_label'),(24666,1075,'property-description_title','Property Description'),(24667,1075,'_property-description_title','field_property_property-description_title'),(24668,1075,'property-description_text','<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Discover 3215 SE 28th Ave — a beautifully finished new construction home in the highly walkable Hosford-Abernethy neighborhood of Southeast Portland.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Priced at $374,900, this home offers 863 sq ft of thoughtfully designed living space with 2 bedrooms, 2 full baths, and 1 partial bath. Built in 2025, the home features a striking modern exterior with warm wood-toned accents and dark contemporary siding, tucked into a beautifully landscaped shared walkway.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">Inside, expect sophisticated finishes, high ceilings, and abundant natural light throughout. The efficient layout makes the most of every square foot, offering low-maintenance, move-in-ready living just four short blocks from the heart of Clinton-Division — one of inner Southeast Portland\'s most beloved dining and shopping corridors.</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\">With a Walk Score of 89 and a Bike Score of 94, this location puts the best of the city right at your doorstep.</p>'),(24669,1075,'_property-description_text','field_property_property-description_text'),(24670,1075,'property-description',''),(24671,1075,'_property-description','field_property_property-description'),(24672,1075,'property-payment_label','Est. Monthly Payment'),(24673,1075,'_property-payment_label','field_property_property-payment_label'),(24674,1075,'property-payment_price',''),(24675,1075,'_property-payment_price','field_property_property-payment_price'),(24676