,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','2. What Is Covered'),(25363,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(25364,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','h2'),(25365,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(25366,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">We review warranty-related concerns on a case-by-case basis and work closely with homeowners to understand and address reported issues.</p>\r\nIf you notice something that requires attention, we encourage you to contact us as soon as possible. Our team will review the situation and help determine the appropriate next steps.'),(25367,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(25368,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','Covered'),(25369,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_1_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(25370,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title','3. What Is Not Covered'),(25371,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(25372,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title-tag','h2'),(25373,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(25374,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Certain items may fall outside of warranty support, including normal wear and tear, routine homeowner maintenance, damage resulting from misuse, unauthorized modifications, or circumstances beyond our control.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you are unsure whether a concern qualifies for review, please reach out to our team. We are happy to answer questions and provide guidance whenever possible.</p>'),(25375,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(25376,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-label','Not Covered'),(25377,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_2_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(25378,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title','4. How to Submit a Claim'),(25379,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(25380,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title-tag','h2'),(25381,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(25382,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">To submit a warranty claim or service request, please complete our online form and provide as much detail as possible.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Helpful information includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\r\n 	<li>Property address</li>\r\n 	<li>Contact information</li>\r\n 	<li>Description of the issue</li>\r\n 	<li>Photos or supporting documentation, if available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nOnce we receive your request, a member of our team will review the information and follow up as needed.'),(25383,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(25384,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-label','Submit a Claim'),(25385,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_3_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(25386,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title','5. Emergency Procedures'),(25387,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(25388,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','h2'),(25389,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(25390,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">If you experience an issue that presents an immediate safety concern or could result in significant property damage, please take appropriate action to protect people and property first.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For emergencies involving fire, gas, electrical hazards, flooding, or other urgent situations, contact the appropriate emergency services or utility provider immediately.</p>\r\nAfter the situation has been addressed, please notify DEZ Development so we can assist with any necessary follow-up.'),(25391,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(25392,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-label','Procedures'),(25393,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_4_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(25394,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title','6. Contact Information'),(25395,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title'),(25396,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','h2'),(25397,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-title-tag','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-title-tag'),(25398,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-content','<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">For warranty inquiries, service requests, or general homeowner support, please contact our team.</p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><b>Dez Development </b></p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Phone: <a href=\"tel:5039946000\">(503) 994-6000</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Email: <a href=\"mailto:Hello@dezdevelopment.com\">Hello@dezdevelopment.com</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">We appreciate the trust you place in DEZ Development and look forward to supporting you throughout your homeownership journey.</p>'),(25399,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-content','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-content'),(25400,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-label','Contact Information'),(25401,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections_5_section-label','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections_section-label'),(25402,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections','6'),(25403,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-sections','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-sections'),(25404,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-updated',''),(25405,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-updated','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-updated'),(25406,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-show-reviewed','0'),(25407,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-show-reviewed','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-show-reviewed'),(25408,1099,'page-blocks_2_content-doc-pdf',''),(25409,1099,'_page-blocks_2_content-doc-pdf','field_pageBlocks_page-blocks_content-doc_content-doc-pdf'),(25410,484,'_cmplz_scanned_post','1'),(25411,481,'_cmplz_scanned_post','1'),(25412,333,'_cmplz_scanned_post','1'),(25413,321,'_cmplz_scanned_post','1'),(25414,61,'_cmplz_scanned_post','1'),(25415,33,'_cmplz_scanned_post','1'),(25416,8,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(25417,8,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','0'),(25418,1100,'page-blocks','a:6:{i:0;s:9:\"hero-hom